{% comment %}
  Lush Beauty Mart — Luxury All Collections & Departments Catalog
  Clean 2-col (mobile) to 4-col (desktop) grid with high contrast and perfect image containment
{% endcomment %}

<section class="lush-all-collections-page" style="padding: 30px 0 60px; background: #FAF7F2; min-height: 70vh;">
